   "text": "Leaves are scores from the evaluation function, read left to right.\nSecond MIN node: after the leaf 2 its value is at most 2, but MAX already has 3 from the first branch.\nalpha (3) >= beta (2), so leaves 4 and 6 are never searched. The root value is 3, the same as Minimax.",
   "originalText": "Leaves are scores from the evaluation function, read left to right.\nSecond MIN node: after the leaf 2 its value is at most 2, but MAX already has 3 from the first branch.\nalpha (3) >= beta (2), so leaves 4 and 6 are never searched. The root value is 3, the same as Minimax.",
